---
// Hero — Editorial typography-first introduction
---

<section class="min-h-[85vh] flex items-end pb-16 md:pb-24 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
  <div class="w-full">
    <!-- Overline -->
    <p
      class="font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-[var(--text-faint)] mb-6 animate-fade-up"
    >
      Software Engineer
    </p>

    <!-- Name -->
    <h1
      class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-medium tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)] leading-[0.95] mb-8 animate-fade-up animate-delay-1"
    >
      Laoska<br />Benyasca
    </h1>

    <!-- Title -->
    <p
      class="font-mono text-sm md:text-base text-[var(--text-muted)] tracking-wide mb-12 animate-fade-up animate-delay-2"
    >
      Backend & Systems Architect
    </p>

    <!-- Divider -->
    <div class="w-16 h-px bg-[var(--border-primary)] mb-10 animate-fade-up animate-delay-3"></div>

    <!-- Narrative -->
    <p
      class="text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-secondary)] max-w-2xl font-light animate-fade-up animate-delay-4"
    >
      Nicaragua to Portugal. From full-spectrum engineering to specialized
      systems architecture. I build the resilient backends powering fintech,
      insurance, and high-scale distributed platforms.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
